      "latex": "\\text{AgBr} + 2\\text{Na}_2\\text{S}_2\\text{O}_3 \\rightarrow 4\\text{Na}^{+} + \\text{Br}^{-} + [\\text{Ag(S}_2\\text{O}_3\\text{)}_2]^{3-}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What is the function of the thiosulfate ion?"
